    "updated_at": "2016-07-07T22:46:40Z",
    "body": "I believe this was added without implementer commitment in 1efac390abb3f95df61f2d2ac6c0feb47349d97b to fix  https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=13154. I guess there was some Mozilla and Google support of the idea.\n\nI was not able to find any open WebKit or Chromium bugs. @tkent-google, @cdumez, @DigiTec, any plans to implement this, or should we remove it?\n",
