    "updated_at": "2016-07-12T10:57:52Z",
    "body": "Well, I guess the main question here is that does any browser vendor plan to implement the feature?\nDoesn't make sense to keep unimplemented/unmaintained features in the specs for years.\nAs far as I know the spec for  ´type=range multiple´ hasn't been reviewed either (since reviewing doesn't happen properly before implementing)\n\n@rniwa @adrianba\n",
