    "created_at": "2016-07-14T18:46:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T18:46:45Z",
    "body": "I think there are definite use cases for this, and I would have loved to see it implemented. However, lacking any implementer commitment, we should probably remove it until such a time as such commitment materializes. If that materializes, we can try for a removal-revert, as is currently being attempted for inert=\"\" in #1474.\n",
